  "details": "The Animator Temporary Pose Space behavior does not function for users in FBT. I am working on several avatar systems that would require this feature to work properly and currently can only function if I disable FBT while using the feature. Additionally, I cannot find any instances in the documentation of this behavior being disabled for FBT users. I would like to be able to use this feature regardless of FBT state, as systems that require Non-FBT tracking have additional ways of checking for FBT before activating the temporary pose space script.",
